# Common Commands Used

### List Images

```bash
docker images
```

Lists all local Docker images.

---

### List Running Containers

```bash
docker ps
```

Displays currently running containers.

---

### Stop a Container

```bash
docker stop <container-name>
```

Stops a running container.

---

### Remove a Container

```bash
docker rm <container-name>
```

Deletes a stopped container.

---

### Build an Image

```bash
docker build -t image:tag .
```

Creates a Docker image using the Dockerfile.

---

### Tag an Image

```bash
docker tag local-image username/repository:tag
```

Prepares an image for Docker Hub.

---

### Push an Image

```bash
docker push username/repository:tag
```

Uploads an image to Docker Hub.

---

### Pull an Image

```bash
docker pull username/repository:tag
```

Downloads an image from Docker Hub.

---

### Run a Container

```bash
docker run -d -p 80:80 username/repository:tag
```

Creates and starts a container.

