# Blockers Encountered

## Docker Command Not Found

Initially, I attempted to run:

```bash
docker commit
```

from inside the running container.

This resulted in:

```
docker: command not found
```

### Resolution

Exited the container using:

```bash
exit
```

and executed the command from the Docker host instead.

---

## Docker Hub Image Not Found

When attempting to run:

```bash
docker run hdaum123/tech610-nginx-auto:1.0
```

Docker returned:

```
image not found
```

### Cause

The local image had not yet been tagged and pushed to Docker Hub.

### Resolution

Tagged the image:

```bash
docker tag tech610-nginx-auto:1.0 hdaum123/tech610-nginx-auto:1.0
```

Then pushed it:

```bash
docker push hdaum123/tech610-nginx-auto:1.0
```

